    "Create a Winter Classic 2026 tune-in journey. Geo-split: Florida fans within 100mi of Miami get an in-person ticket-buy CTA, all other fans get a national tune-in CTA for ESPN+. Per-fav-team variants for Panthers and Rangers supporters. 10% holdout for A/B test.",
